    <l n="4" para="true">153. Circa <i>aurum</i> &amp; <i>argentum</i> sunt Bracteaa-</l>
    <l n="5">ria; Aurifabrilis, in qua Inauratoria, Cœlatoria,</l>
    <l n="6">Annularia, Monetaria.</l>
    <l n="7" para="true">154. Circa <i>aes</i> sunt fusoria aramentorum,</l>
    <l n="8">campanarum, tormentorum, &amp;c.</l>
    <l n="9" para="true">155. Circa <i>ferrum</i> est ferrifabrilis qualiscunq-</l>
    <l n="10">ue, Clauftrarii, Machaeropoei, Calcarificis, Lo-</l>
    <l n="11">ricarii, Armamentarii, Cultrarii, Falcificis, &amp;c.</l>
    <l n="12" para="true">156. Circa <i>cuprum</i> est Cuprifabrilis; <i>Stannum</i>,</l>
    <l n="13">Stannaria; <i>Plumbum</i>, plumbaria.</l>
    <l n="14" para="true">157. Circa <i>minerialia media naturae</i> sunt circa</l>
    <l n="15">Salem excoquendum, praeparandum, Salaria;</l>
    <l n="16">argillam, Figulina; Vitrum, Vitraria.</l>
    <l n="17" para="true">158. Circa <i>animata</i> sunt circa vel <i>plantas</i>, vel</l>
    <l n="18">
      <i>animalia</i>. Et circa <i>hæc</i> vel <i>rationalia</i>, homines</l>
    <l n="19">scilicet, vel <i>bruta</i>.</l>
